OL,3,GNEWSABackpacks have essentials for
OL,4,Ayoung people in care
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of backpacks containing
OL,7,Fessential items are being made
OL,8,Favailable to children and young people
OL,9,Fwho enter care unexpectedly.
OL,11,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council has
OL,12,Freceived 400 backpacks provided by the
OL,13,FHEY Smile Foundation and Nurture a
OL,14,FChild charities.
OL,16,FThey contain things including shampoo,
OL,17,Fa toothbrush and toothpaste, deodorant
OL,18,Fand sanitary products.
