OL,3,GNEWSABackpacks have essentials for
OL,4,Ayoung people in care
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These backpacks are a simple idea, but
OL,7,Fthey can make a real difference. They
OL,8,Fmean that when a child or young person
OL,9,Farrives into care unexpectedly, there
OL,10,Fis something ready for them ` something
OL,11,Fpractical that is theirs to keep and
OL,12,Fuse," said Jamie Lewis, of HEY Smile
OL,13,FFoundation.
